  <h2>The SDK forks</h2>
  <p>The RevenueDot SDKs are forks of RevenueCat's MIT-licensed SDKs. Each keeps RevenueCat's original copyright notice and adds ours for our changes. They keep RevenueCat's module and package names only so existing app code compiles unchanged; they are published under RevenueDot names and are not RevenueCat products.</p>

